=== task: order easy
title: Searching for 9
prompt: Binary search looks for 9 in `[1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13]`. Put the steps in order.
items:
- Check index 3: 7 is smaller than 9, so lo = 4
- Check index 5: 11 is bigger than 9, so hi = 4
